{
  "id": "p25",
  "title": "The Charity Day at the Airfield",
  "titleZh": "机场的慈善日",
  "topic": "慈善活动与事故",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "A local airfield welcomes a royal guest this sunny morning.",
        "zh": "一个本地小机场在这个晴朗的早晨迎来一位王室贵宾。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young princess and a famous actor open the charity day.",
        "zh": "一位年轻的公主和一位著名演员为慈善日揭幕。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They play golf beside the main tent of a drinks brand.",
        "zh": "他们在一个饮料品牌的主帐篷旁打高尔夫。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt's small van sells ice cream in every sweet flavour.",
        "zh": "我姑姑的小货车卖各种甜味的冰淇淋。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A bright display shows how they apply the new design.",
        "zh": "一个明亮的展台展示了他们如何应用新设计。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Guests from every continent give tremendous praise to the team.",
        "zh": "来自各大洲的客人对团队大加赞赏。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a small aircraft waits while a loud warning tests the speakers.",
        "zh": "然后一架小飞机等待着，响亮的警报声在测试喇叭。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Suddenly a kitchen pump begins to explode with a sharp bang.",
        "zh": "突然，厨房里的水泵轰的一声开始爆裂。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The damage is small, but one injury still needs quick help.",
        "zh": "损坏不大，但有一处伤仍需要紧急处理。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Helpers transport the cook and commit to his full care.",
        "zh": "帮手们把厨师送走，并承诺全力照顾他。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A safety inspector checks the permit beside the open gate.",
        "zh": "一位安全检查员在开着的大门旁检查许可证。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Officials withdraw the licence and arrest the careless night manager.",
        "zh": "官员吊销了执照，并逮捕了粗心的夜班经理。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The operator blames weak management for the failed test.",
        "zh": "运营商把失败的测试归咎于管理薄弱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An internal report describes a slow shift in one key aspect.",
        "zh": "一份内部报告描述了某个关键方面缓慢的转变。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later their professional team admits it was not prepared.",
        "zh": "后来他们的专业团队承认没有做好准备。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A written declaration must explain each broken part clearly.",
        "zh": "一份书面声明必须清楚地解释每个损坏的部件。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The scientific team works in a calm and careful manner.",
        "zh": "科学团队以冷静细致的方式工作。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Moreover, public faith in the small airfield falls very fast.",
        "zh": "此外，公众对这个小机场的信心下降得很快。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My father, basically, wants a sensible plan for safety.",
        "zh": "我父亲基本上想要一个明智的安全方案。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A prominent doctor asks a favour for the injured cook.",
        "zh": "一位有名望的医生为受伤的厨师求了一个人情。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "We owe the guests an appropriate answer and a full refund.",
        "zh": "我们欠客人一个恰当的答复和全额退款。"
      },
      {
        "en": "This valuable lesson changes the ambition of the whole team.",
        "zh": "这个宝贵的教训改变了整个团队的志向。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Twin goals win widespread support across the little town.",
        "zh": "双重目标赢得了小镇上的广泛支持。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the week, the accident has a real impact on every small household.",
        "zh": "这一周里，这起事故对每个小家庭都有实际影响。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They renew the old film reel about the early days of flight.",
        "zh": "他们续订了那卷关于早期飞行的老胶片。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Further tests will find a safer alternative in an instant.",
        "zh": "进一步的测试会在一瞬间找到更安全的替代方案。"
      },
      {
        "en": "No worker is immune to the striking facts in the final report.",
        "zh": "没有工人能对最终报告里那些触目惊心的事实免疫。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My sister, considering the cost, leans toward a much simpler plan.",
        "zh": "我姐姐考虑成本后，倾向于一个简单得多的方案。"
      }
    ]
  ],
